@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-37 - Add Order Note

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-37
FE -> API: PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
API -> Service: Execute Add Order Note
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Ghi chú được thêm vào order

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang xem chi tiết đơn hàng
Post: Ghi chú được thêm vào order
Main flow:
1. Admin nhập note vào ô text
2. Admin bấm Add Note
3. System gọi API PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
4. Note được thêm vào bill.notes[]
end note
@enduml
